/E (One day, an old beggar came to Nyai Endit's house. He asked her for some food and water. Unfortunately, Nyai Endit refused to help him and rudely told him to leave.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 139 0 R
/E (One day, the village experienced a famine. Many villagers had difficulty finding food. They went to Nyai Endit and asked for help. However, instead of helping them, Nyai Endit sold food at very high prices. She did not feel sorry for the poor villagers.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
